[{"client_msg_id":"fa3bc7b6-8b94-4899-b657-c78740d1f0c6","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ウィンドウのリサイズはマウスでやってます","ts":"1614790566.015000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W=G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53cb39f1-13f6-4616-968c-ede44edf8e7f","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"よく使うもの\nprefix s → セッション切り替え\nprefix 数字 → 数字のウィンドウに移動\nprefix hjkl → pane 間の移動（これはマッピングしている）\nprefix \" → vertical split\nprefix % → horizontal split\nprefix [ → visual mode に入る。キーマップにより hjkl に移動、y でヤンクなどができるようにしている\nくらいですね","ts":"1614790552.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IsH="}]},{"client_msg_id":"68eaac2d-3220-4819-b0b3-0fe355a8e7a4","type":"message","user":"U01NHAYE0BV","text":"最近使い始めたのは prefix + q -\u0026gt; 数字 で移動ですね。pane切りすぎたときの移動に役立つかも","ts":"1614789516.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jSlMm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9b5e1a0-9d0e-4e30-9f6f-642242e9b647","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"prefix + hjklでpane間の移動と prefix + Ctrl-(hjkl)でリサイズくらいしかマッピングして使えてないなあ","ts":"1614787653.011500","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1614787865.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9B7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70decb66-04fc-429d-b50e-c9228c20cdb2","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"解像度の高いディスプレイを常用しているとpaneバシバシ切ります。でも細かいサイズ調整とかは適当ですね。","ts":"1614787499.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RuW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5bf66e9a-a8c9-4227-855b-99a6675b06a9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"pane は何かを同時に見たい時にたまに切るけど、同じく操作をろくに覚えてないので用が済んだら元に戻しちゃう。pane 間の移動、順繰り移動(prefix + o)しか覚えてないので 3 つ以上に分割しちゃうと移動効率が悪い…","ts":"1614786070.008900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ON=q3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c488e96-46b9-4930-8cd4-386a3df6c25d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いい加減 tmux pane の使い方覚えないと怒られるな。お尻ペーンって。","ts":"1614785285.006700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":2,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tJro"}]},{"client_msg_id":"945033c0-f386-4fbe-9160-19db8da524e0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"pane は僕も切らないな。同じく操作を覚えてない。","ts":"1614785248.006000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vXni"}]}]
